            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 127594,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa nama variabel counter dalam kode ini?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada variabel counter dalam kode</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Code: Counter variable",
            "id": 127595,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan variabel <code>counter</code> untuk menetapkan kondisi kurang dari <code>11</code> dalam bahasa Swift.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating payroll&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>while</code>, diikuti oleh <code>counter</code>, lalu <code>&lt;</code>, <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing the counter",
            "id": 127596,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
